"text": "[image: An inspiring night at the @cincinnatinaacp dinner celebrating change makers who are unapologetic in the ongoing work to protect freedom, justice, and democracy. This year’s event was packed with more than 1500 attendees, and no one in this room plans to sit on the sidelines for this election.]",
