},
{
"text": "[image: Early voting begins today! You don’t have to wait to make your voice heard. Go vote! 🔗www.iwillvote.com/oh]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeJvlLmvnI7/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Great to be in a room full of educators and champions of Ohio’s students to talk about the importance of November’s election for the future of public education in Ohio! Thank you to the @ohioea for inviting me to speak at their All-Committee meeting, which brings together educators from across the state to work on issues important to our students, schools, and teachers. A huge congratulations to my colleague and retired teacher, @brennanforohio for recognition of his work to support aspiring and new teachers.⭐️🍎]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeCIOv9ICQC/"
},
{
"text": "[image: My opponent seems to spend most of his time talking about me, but I’m kinda busy fighting for Ohio voters.💅]",
